monster-slaying prowess was one of a kind.","nextNodeIds":[760810102]},{"nodeId":760810102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1314,"speakerName":"Flins","textMapHash":4187557738,"text":"He vanished in the wake of a great battle, and so this empty grave was built in his honor.","nextNodeIds":[760810103]},{"nodeId":760810103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1314,"speakerName":"Flins","textMapHash":2064937178,"text":"A purple blade and golden hair... He must be the wandering warrior who clashes with the Wild Hunt.","nextNodeIds":[760810104]},{"nodeId":760810104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1314,"speakerName":"Flins","textMapHash":2366417506,"text":"It seems his spirit has not been able to find rest in his grave, just like the many spirits in the Final Night Cemetery.","nextNodeIds":[760810105]},{"nodeId":760810105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1314,"speakerName":"Flins","textMapHash":325855890,"text":"Raising his sword against the Hunt, the hero's spirit remains unwavering, even after death.","nextNodeIds":[760810106]},{"nodeId":760810106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1314,"speakerName":"Flins","textMapHash":4003712266,"text":"...Sir Sigurd, you are a man worthy of my respect.","nextNodeIds":[760810107]},{"nodeId":760810107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1314,"speakerName":"Flins","textMapHash":3670139570,"text":"Yet, to fight in solitude for naught but hatred and one's sense of duty is far too cruel a fate for a warrior such as you.","nextNodeIds":[760810108]},{"nodeId":760810108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1314,"speakerName":"Flins","textMapHash":3953008666,"text":"Do you miss the days you shared drinks and songs with your fellow Lightkeepers, Sigurd? Have you any reason to wield your blade now, save a hunger to slaughter your foes?","nextNodeIds":[760810109]},{"nodeId":760810109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1314,"speakerName":"Flins","textMapHash":1232709234,"text":"If so, then show yourself. Let us spar, just like old times, just as it was in your days as a Lightkeeper.","nextNodeIds":[]}]},{"talkId":7608103,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["0","2","76081","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_SET_QUEST_VAR"},{"param":["7608102","2","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_SET_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"},{"param":["133601331","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NOTIFY_GROUP_LUA_TALK_FINISH"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":true,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":false,"newTalkFinishTime":false,"onlyQuestNpc":true,"participantId":[],"prePerformCfg":"","questIdleTalk":false,"randomTalkPos":0,"randomTalkPriorityList":[],"removeDuplicatedRandomTalk":false,"stayFreeStyle":false,"talkMarkHideList":[],"talkMarkType":"TALK_MARK_NONE","activeMode":"PLAY_MODE_HOST","beginCond":[{"param":["7608102","2","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL"},{"param":["10000127","0","0","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_PLAYER_CURRENT_AVATAR"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"QUEST_COND_NONE"}],"beginCondComb":"LOGIC_NONE","beginWay":"TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_LOCAL","id":7608103,"initDialog":760810301,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[22183],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/WQ/NodKrai_76081/Q7608103","priority":10,"questId":76081,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":760810301,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1324,"speakerName":"Illuga","textMapHash":2064407730,"text":"Mr. Sigurd, I owe you my life. If you hadn't led the Lightkeepers south to hold the line back then, I might have died without even knowing how, and my body would be nowhere to be found...","nextNodeIds":[760810302]},{"nodeId":760810302,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1324,"speakerName":"Illuga","textMapHash":314262330,"text":"But why has your spirit not found rest? Why are you still wandering, still fighting?","nextNodeIds":[760810303]},{"nodeId":760810303,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1324,"speakerName":"Illuga","textMapHash":3143019562,"text":"Tainted by the Wild Hunt's corruption, with your very form shattered... It seems you never truly left that battlefield, did you? For you, the war has never ended.","nextNodeIds":[760810304]},{"nodeId":760810304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1324,"speakerName":"Illuga","textMapHash":3662708370,"text":"In that sense, perhaps I'm not so different from you. None of us will find true peace until the Wild Hunt is gone for good.","nextNodeIds":[760810305]},{"nodeId":760810305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1324,"speakerName":"Illuga","textMapHash":3726220058,"text":"It's an honor to meet you, Mr. Sigurd.","nextNodeIds":[760810306]},{"nodeId":760810306,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1324,"speakerName":"Illuga","textMapHash":625276242,"text":"I understand now. For a Lightkeeper, the best form of communication is done with blades in hand.","nextNodeIds":[760810307]},{"nodeId":760810307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1324,"speakerName":"Illuga","textMapHash":923877394,"text":"Then allow me to show you the strength of the new generation of Lightkeepers.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7608101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7608103,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_CO